inputs.description:
Optional structured inputs passed alongside `goal`. BioMate's inner AI sees these as a JSON block appended to the goal text and merges them with any parameters it extracts from the goal string. Use this to pass: S3 keys from upload_file, sequences, SMILES lists, accession numbers, or explicit parameter overrides. Examples:
  After upload_file: {"fastq_file": "users/42/uploads/uuid-sample.fastq.gz"} (use the s3_key value returned by upload_file)
  SMILES list: {"smiles_list": ["CC(=O)Oc1ccccc1C(=O)O"], "organism": "human"}
  Parameter override: {"genome": "GRCh38", "aligner": "STAR", "fdr": 0.05}

